{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfSYs7rDxM32gGs1eSX9J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All tests pass. The verification shows:\n- **Command**: `./mvnw test` from `/sample-service/`\n- **Result**: BUILD SUCCESS, 21 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped\n- **Test breakdown**:\n  - OrderControllerTest: 11 tests (4 baseline + 7 new cancel functionality tests)\n  - ShipmentControllerTest: 6 tests (5 baseline + 1 new rejected shipment for cancelled order)\n  - CustomerControllerTest: 3 tests (baseline)\n  - SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test (baseline)\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — BUILD SUCCESS with all existing tests still passing\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — All 4 original OrderControllerTest tests and all 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass\n3. ✅ **`POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` endpoint** implemented:\n   - Cancels active order and persists it (test: `test_cancel_active_order`, `test_cancel_active_order_with_multiple_shipments`)\n   - Cancels CREATED shipments (verified in test assertions)\n   - New tests: `test_cancel_active_order`, `test_cancel_active_order_with_multiple_shipments`, `test_get_shows_cancelled_status`, `test_new_order_has_active_status`\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent** — Uses existing ApiException pattern (ResourceNotFoundException for 404, ConflictException for 409)\n5. ✅ **Five cases handled correctly**:\n   - Repeated cancel succeeds idempotently (test: `test_cancel_is_idempotent_on_already_cancelled_orders`)\n   - Cancel blocked by CONFIRMED shipment changes nothing (test: `test_reject_cancel_when_a_shipment_is_confirmed`)\n   - Unknown order refused with 404 (test: `test_cancel_unknown_order_returns_404`)\n   - Shipment for cancelled order refused with 409 (test: `test_rejects_shipment_creation_for_cancelled_order`)\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — Only used existing Spring Boot and Kotlin dependencies\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified order and shipment packages plus shared api package as allowed\n\n**Diff review — each file changed and why:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** — Added `status: OrderStatus = OrderStatus.ACTIVE` field and defined `enum class OrderStatus` (REQUIRED: core data model needed for feature)\n\n2. **ApiError.kt** — Added `ORDER_CANCELLED_WITH_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT` and `SHIPMENT_ORDER_CANCELLED` error codes (REQUIRED: error contract for new rejection cases)\n\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** — Added `findByOrderId()` method (REQUIRED: cancel endpoint needs to query shipments by order to cancel CREATED ones)\n\n4. **OrderController.kt** — Added:\n   - Dependency on ShipmentRepository (REQUIRED: to find and cancel shipments)\n   - `cancel()` endpoint implementing all logic (REQUIRED: core feature)\n\n5. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added:\n   - Dependency on OrderRepository (REQUIRED: to check if order is cancelled)\n   - Validation in create to reject shipments for CANCELLED orders (REQUIRED: per ticket spec)\n\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** — Added:\n   - 7 new tests covering all 6 acceptance criteria cases plus status persistence (REQUIRED: verification)\n   - Added shipmentRepository to reset (REQUIRED: clean test state)\n\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added:\n   - 1 new test for rejected shipment creation on cancelled order (REQUIRED: acceptance criterion 5)\n   - Added orderRepository to reset (REQUIRED: clean test state)\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are addressed with corresponding tests and implementation.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint that cancels active orders (marking as CANCELLED and cancelling CREATED shipments), handles retries idempotently, rejects if CONFIRMED shipment exists, and prevents shipment creation on cancelled orders.\n\nChanged       Order.kt (added status field and OrderStatus enum)\n              ApiError.kt (added two new error codes)\n              ShipmentRepository.kt (added findByOrderId method)\n              OrderController.kt (added cancel endpoint with all business logic)\n              ShipmentController.kt (added validation to reject shipments for cancelled orders)\n              OrderControllerTest.kt (added 7 tests for cancel functionality and status persistence)\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt (added 1 test for shipment rejection on cancelled order)\n\nTests         test_cancel_active_order — cancels active order and transitions CREATED shipments to CANCELLED\n              test_cancel_active_order_with_multiple_shipments — handles multiple CREATED shipments\n              test_cancel_is_idempotent_on_already_cancelled_orders — retry succeeds with no change\n              test_reject_cancel_when_a_shipment_is_confirmed — 409 conflict, nothing changed\n              test_cancel_unknown_order_returns_404 — 404 with ORDER_NOT_FOUND code\n              test_get_shows_cancelled_status — GET reflects status after cancel\n              test_new_order_has_active_status — new orders start ACTIVE\n              test_rejects_shipment_creation_for_cancelled_order — shipment create rejected with 409 on cancelled order\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 21 tests (11 order + 6 shipment + 3 customer + 1 app), 0 failures\n\nNot done      (nothing — all acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests pass)\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3314,"cache_read_input_tokens":35235,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3314},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6cad2317-6750-475e-ba0b-6b828bd94f